   26	 * The module's only policy is the order, and it is the level the host asks for: the easiest unlock
   27	 * first. A player picks up the small prerequisites as they go, and ordering by the requirement
   28	 * rather than by the building is what keeps the plan from rushing the largest shipyard in the game
   29	 * while the account still has no laboratory. Only the level the host asks for counts, because level
   30	 * one of a robotics factory never unlocks a shipyard and treating "something is built" as done would
